     8| *       sends SMS via Twilio. Returns { success, expiresIn: 300 }.
     9| *
    10| *   POST { action: "verify_otp", phone: "+919876543210", otp: "123456" }
    11| *     → Verifies OTP hash, creates/finds the Supabase Auth user (phone identity),
    12| *       generates a session, returns { success, access_token, refresh_token, user }.
    13| *
    14| * Twilio credentials are passed via x-twilio-account-sid / x-twilio-auth-token
    15| * headers from the Android app (injected at build time from Rork private env vars).
